Prominent modification notice
-----------------------------

This distribution has been modified from the upstream sol-azy project.
Vertexy modifications began on 2026-08-20 and include, among other changes:

- rebranding the project and CLI as Vertexy;
- restructuring public CLI names and help text while retaining migration aliases;
- propagating command failures as non-zero process exits for automation use;
- adding public repository documentation and community files;
- adding CI, documentation, dependency-update, and release automation;
- adding project artwork and refreshed usage documentation.

Original authorship notices and rule-author metadata are retained where they
appear in the source. This notice does not imply endorsement by FuzzingLabs.
